步骤 2:
- 目的: 分析文件中的Unicode字符，识别其编码值（如U+2003等空格），并尝试将其转换为二进制数据以恢复隐藏信息。
- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "分析文件中的Unicode字符，识别其编码值（如U+2003等空格），并尝试将其转换为二进制数据以恢复隐藏信息。", "arguments": {"code": "import unicodedata\nwith open('/home/gem/workspace/attachments/whitepages.txt', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n    print(f'File length: {len(content)}')\n    unique_chars = set(content)\n    print('Unique characters:')\n    for char in unique_chars:\n        try:\n            name = unicodedata.name(char)\n            print(f'{repr(char)} -> {name}')\n        except ValueError:\n            print(f'{repr(char)} -> No name')\n    # Check for specific whitespace pattern\n    print('\\nFirst 50 chars repr:', repr(content[:50]))\n    # Check if all chars are whitespace or specific known chars\n    # Since head output showed U+2003 (Em Space), let's count them\n    if ' ' in content:\n        print('Found Em Space (U+2003)')\n    if ' ' in content:\n        print('Found regular space')"}}
